# Positive guiding-center turbulence in the supplied ITER.geo wall: 11,520 blobs.
# 300k minimum triangles; DG p=6, h=0.014, SI-BDF2 dt=0.005 to T=50.
# Positivity is checked initially and every 10 accepted endpoints; no limiter.
# Fast native Poisson cycle; robust hybrid/CSR retries, then FGMRES/DILU.
--preset positive_turbulence_iter_si_bdf2_p6_h014_dt0005_t50_raw_cuda_bsr
